{"seq":7,"slug":"lc0236-lowest-common-ancestor","title":"LeetCode 236 二叉树的最近公共祖先","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-tree-graph/lc0236-lowest-common-ancestor","wordCount":1045,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-236-二叉树的最近公共祖先\">LeetCode 236 二叉树的最近公共祖先</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个二叉树，找到该树中两个指定节点的<strong>最近公共祖先</strong>（LCA，Lowest Common Ancestor）。</p>\n<p>最近公共祖先的定义为：对于有根树 T 的两个节点 p、q，最近公共祖先表示为一个节点 x，满足 x 是 p、q 的祖先且 x 的深度尽可能大（一个节点也可以是它自己的祖先）。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>root = [3,5,1,6,2,0,8,null,null,7,4]</code>, <code>p = 5</code>, <code>q = 1</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>3</code></li>\n<li>解释：节点 5 和节点 1 的最近公共祖先是节点 3。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>root = [3,5,1,6,2,0,8,null,null,7,4]</code>, <code>p = 5</code>, <code>q = 4</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>5</code></li>\n<li>解释：节点 5 和节点 4 的最近公共祖先是节点 5，因为根据定义最近公共祖先节点可以是节点本身。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>root = [1,2]</code>, <code>p = 1</code>, <code>q = 2</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>1</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>树中节点数目在范围 <code>[2, 10^5]</code> 内</li>\n<li><code>-10^9 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 10^9</code></li>\n<li>所有 <code>Node.val</code> 互不相同</li>\n<li><code>p != q</code></li>\n<li><code>p</code> 和 <code>q</code> 均存在于给定的二叉树中</li>\n</ul>\n<p>LCA 是树上最经典的问题之一，在实际工程中广泛应用于版本控制（查找分支交点）、文件系统（查找共同父目录）等场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"后序-dfs-递归\">后序 DFS 递归</h3><p>本题的核心思路是利用后序遍历（左→右→根）的「汇报」机制：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>递归遍历左子树，看是否找到 p 或 q</li>\n<li>递归遍历右子树，看是否找到 p 或 q</li>\n<li>根据左右子树的返回结果判断：<ul>\n<li><strong>左右都找到</strong>：说明 p 和 q 分别在当前节点的左右子树中，当前节点就是 LCA</li>\n<li><strong>只有左边找到</strong>：LCA 在左子树中，向上传递左子树的结果</li>\n<li><strong>只有右边找到</strong>：LCA 在右子树中，向上传递右子树的结果</li>\n<li><strong>都没找到</strong>：向上传递 null</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>为什么是后序遍历？</strong> 因为我们需要先知道左右子树的结果，才能判断当前节点是否为 LCA。这正是「先处理子问题，再处理当前问题」的后序特征。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情况</th>\n<th>left 返回</th>\n<th>right 返回</th>\n<th>当前节点返回</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>p、q 分居两侧</td>\n<td>非 null</td>\n<td>非 null</td>\n<td>当前节点（LCA）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>都在左子树</td>\n<td>非 null</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>left 的返回值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>都在右子树</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>非 null</td>\n<td>right 的返回值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当前节点是 p 或 q</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>当前节点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class TreeNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  left: TreeNode | null;&#10;  right: TreeNode | null;&#10;  constructor(val?: number, left?: TreeNode | null, right?: TreeNode | null) {&#10;    this.val = val ?? 0;&#10;    this.left = left ?? null;&#10;    this.right = right ?? null;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function lowestCommonAncestor(root: TreeNode | null, p: TreeNode, q: TreeNode): TreeNode | null {&#10;  if (root === null || root === p || root === q) {&#10;    return root;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const left = lowestCommonAncestor(root.left, p, q);&#10;  const right = lowestCommonAncestor(root.right, p, q);&#10;&#10;  if (left !== null &amp;&amp; right !== null) {&#10;    return root;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return left !== null ? left : right;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lowestCommonAncestor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">q</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (root </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> root </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> root </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> root;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lowestCommonAncestor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(root.left, p, q);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lowestCommonAncestor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(root.right, p, q);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> root;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>代码简洁性分析：</strong> 这段代码虽然只有不到 10 行核心逻辑，但包含了所有情况的处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>root === null</code>：到达叶子节点以下，返回 null</li>\n<li><code>root === p || root === q</code>：找到目标节点，立即返回（不再深入）</li>\n<li><code>left &amp;&amp; right</code> 都非空：当前节点是 LCA</li>\n<li>只有一侧非空：向上传递该侧的结果</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"执行过程示例\">执行过程示例</h3><p>以 <code>root = [3,5,1,6,2,0,8,null,null,7,4]</code>，<code>p = 5</code>，<code>q = 4</code> 为例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"        3&#10;       / \\&#10;      5   1&#10;     / \\ / \\&#10;    6  2 0  8&#10;      / \\&#10;     7   4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>        3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       / \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      5   1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     / \\ / \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    6  2 0  8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      / \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     7   4</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>递归调用</th>\n<th>节点</th>\n<th>left</th>\n<th>right</th>\n<th>返回</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>dfs(6)</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>null</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dfs(7)</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>null</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dfs(4)</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>4（p=4匹配）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dfs(2)</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>null(7)</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dfs(5)</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>5（q=5匹配）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dfs(0)</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>null</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dfs(8)</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>null</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dfs(1)</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>null</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dfs(3)</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意：<code>dfs(5)</code> 直接返回 5（因为 <code>root === q</code>），不再向下递归。节点 4 的信息通过 <code>dfs(2) → dfs(5)</code> 向上传递，但因为 5 本身就是目标，所以在 5 处就截断了。最终 <code>dfs(3)</code> 的 left=5, right=null，返回 5。</p>\n<p><strong>为什么结果是 5 而不是 3？</strong> 因为 <code>dfs(5)</code> 匹配到 <code>root === q</code> 后立即返回，不再检查其子树。4 作为 5 的后代，其公共祖先就是 5 本身。</p>\n<h3 id=\"bst-上的-lca\">BST 上的 LCA</h3><p>如果树是二叉搜索树（LC #235），可以利用 BST 性质简化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function lowestCommonAncestorBST(root: TreeNode | null, p: TreeNode, q: TreeNode): TreeNode | null {&#10;  let current = root;&#10;  while (current !== null) {&#10;    if (p.val &lt; current.val &amp;&amp; q.val &lt; current.val) {&#10;      current = current.left;&#10;    } else if (p.val &gt; current.val &amp;&amp; q.val &gt; current.val) {&#10;      current = current.right;&#10;    } else {&#10;      return current;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  return null;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lowestCommonAncestorBST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">q</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> root;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (p.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.val) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (p.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.val) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.right;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>最坏情况遍历所有节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(h)</td>\n<td>递归栈深度，h 为树高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> 每个节点最多被访问一次。当 p 和 q 分别位于最深的叶子节点时，需要遍历所有节点，因此最坏 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> 递归栈深度等于树高 h。平衡二叉树 h = O(log n)，退化为链表时 h = O(n)。</p>\n<p>LCA 问题是面试高频考点，也是许多复杂树算法的基础。掌握后序递归的「汇报」思想后，还可以解决树上路径和（LC #124）、树的直径（LC #543）等需要同时考虑左右子树信息的问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 236 二叉树的最近公共祖先","id":"leetcode-236-二叉树的最近公共祖先"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"后序 DFS 递归","id":"后序-dfs-递归"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"执行过程示例","id":"执行过程示例"},{"level":3,"text":"BST 上的 LCA","id":"bst-上的-lca"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 199 二叉树的右视图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-tree-graph/lc0199-binary-tree-right-side-view"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 200 岛屿数量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-tree-graph/lc0200-number-of-islands"}}